# SHA-256 fingerprints of certificates the native kcctl binary rejects in any chain, in the format
# of the JDK's lib/security/blocked.certs. native-image reads that file at build time, so
# etc/blocked-certificates.sh adds these entries to the build JDK's copy before the native build
# and checks the built binary for them afterwards.
#
# Eight intermediate CAs with compromised private keys, each with its cross-signed certificate:
